    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Barzakh: Star Gardener?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barzakh: Star Gardener</strong> is an <strong>adventure-puzzle</strong> game inspired by <strong>Sufi</strong> mysticism and the poetic spirit of <strong>The Little Prince</strong>. In the game, Emir, stranded in a desert after a plane crash, embarks on a metaphysical journey. He nurtures a garden within his mind, growing it with stars discovered along the way. Other selves accompany him on this journey, and he explores unfamiliar universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, What is \u2018Barzakh\u2019?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barzakh, in Islamic mysticism, is the invisible veil between the worldly life and the afterlife\u2014a space of transition and seeking. In <strong>Barzakh: Star Gardener</strong>, this concept symbolizes Emir\u2019s spiritual journey born from desert solitude. He searches for lost stars across different universes, encountering giants in medieval darkness or solving challenging puzzles in worlds where physics bends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stars and the Star Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emir uncovers hidden stars in universes by solving puzzles. Each star points to a word. Every universe or section has its own star and word. As stars are collected, a journey into Emir\u2019s mind begins, planting star seeds in his garden. As a star gardener, he nurtures his stars. At the end of each section, he faces his past in this garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Three <strong>playtest</strong> versions will be released before Next Fest. Play these versions and share your feedback on <strong>Discord</strong>. Your community\u2019s voice will play a key role in the game\u2019s development!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Barzakh: Star Gardener?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barzakh: Star Gardener</strong> is an <strong>adventure-puzzle</strong> game inspired by <strong>Sufi</strong> mysticism and the poetic spirit of <strong>The Little Prince</strong>. In the game, Emir, stranded in a desert after a plane crash, embarks on a metaphysical journey. He nurtures a garden within his mind, growing it with stars discovered along the way. Other selves accompany him on this journey, and he explores unfamiliar universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, What is \u2018Barzakh\u2019?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barzakh, in Islamic mysticism, is the invisible veil between the worldly life and the afterlife\u2014a space of transition and seeking. In <strong>Barzakh: Star Gardener</strong>, this concept symbolizes Emir\u2019s spiritual journey born from desert solitude. He searches for lost stars across different universes, encountering giants in medieval darkness or solving challenging puzzles in worlds where physics bends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stars and the Star Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emir uncovers hidden stars in universes by solving puzzles. Each star points to a word. Every universe or section has its own star and word. As stars are collected, a journey into Emir\u2019s mind begins, planting star seeds in his garden. As a star gardener, he nurtures his stars. At the end of each section, he faces his past in this garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.poster.avif?t=1755439181\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.webm?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.mp4?t=1755439181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Three <strong>playtest</strong> versions will be released before Next Fest. Play these versions and share your feedback on <strong>Discord</strong>. Your community\u2019s voice will play a key role in the game\u2019s development!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A journey starts with a plane crash, pulling Emir into secret realms. Collect lost stars, each a seed of truth. Solve puzzles, grow your mind's garden, and find your fate's word. Guided by stars, discover yourself. Barzakh: The Star Gardener, a tale of spiritual quest.",
